@Web_HostAddress = http://localhost:5211

### 1. Crear una categoría (para tener un CategoryId válido)
POST {{Web_HostAddress}}/Categories
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Periféricos"
}

###

### 2. Obtener todas las categorías
GET {{Web_HostAddress}}/Categories
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

###

### 3. Crear Producto 1 (Teclado)
POST {{Web_HostAddress}}/Products
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Teclado",
  "description": "Teclado mecánico RGB",
  "price": 45000.00,
  "stock": 15,
  "categoryId": 1,
  "image": "teclado.jpg"
}

###

### 4. Crear Producto 2 (Mouse Gamer)
POST {{Web_HostAddress}}/Products
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Mouse Gamer",
  "description": "Mouse óptico sensor de alta precisión",
  "price": 28500.50,
  "stock": 10,
  "categoryId": 1,
  "image": "mouse.jpg"
}

###

### 5. Obtener todos los productos
GET {{Web_HostAddress}}/Products
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

###

### 6. Obtener un producto por ID
GET {{Web_HostAddress}}/Products/1
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

###

### 7. Eliminar un producto por ID
DELETE {{Web_HostAddress}}/Products/1
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
